{"v":1,"status":"published","page_url":"https://his.fm/episodes/manager-notes/what-the-reorg-did-not-write","title":"这次 reorg 没写到的那一层","description":"公司里一个几千人的部门做组织架构调整，字面上压缩的是中层管理，真正受冲击的却是通知里没写到的一线执行岗。这一期从这次调整讲起：AI 接住执行以后，转岗回来的资深管理者怎样在同级比较里和原来的工程师竞争；为什么“百分之一留下来”的比例里，离开的人会转化成 AI 用量和组织知识；组织又为什么终将走向“蒸馏”，让个人经验变成公司自己的 AI 大脑的养分。结尾给出一个“十个人留一个”的自我估算。","show":"his.fm","column":"主理人手札","episode_label":"主理人手札 EP.03","published_at":"2026-10-21T22:49:32.000Z","cover":{"url":"https://f.no.mt/productions/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/cover-1-5e05b1c1-6a1e-4f3e-8244-76b97db9410a.png","width":1400,"height":1400,"sizes":[{"url":"https://his.fm/media/episode-thumbnails/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/1/stillwood/160.webp","width":160},{"url":"https://his.fm/media/episode-thumbnails/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/1/stillwood/240.webp","width":240},{"url":"https://his.fm/media/episode-thumbnails/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/1/stillwood/320.webp","width":320},{"url":"https://his.fm/media/episode-thumbnails/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/1/stillwood/480.webp","width":480},{"url":"https://his.fm/media/episode-thumbnails/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/1/stillwood/640.webp","width":640},{"url":"https://his.fm/media/episode-thumbnails/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/1/stillwood/960.webp","width":960}],"frame_svg":"https://his.fm/brand/frames/stillwood.svg"},"theme":{"name":"雾林来信","accent":"#A6AF94","ink":"#263C35","paper":"#ECEBE1"},"duration":558,"audio":{"url":"https://f.no.mt/productions/92cd194d-0585-4d7c-a167-7bb5bdffdb03/audio-1-2e366f4e-1b10-47d0-837e-fd5da6f18d44.mp3","mime":"audio/mpeg","bytes":8931500}}